                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d3641689-a3ad-325a-97b4-bf3a54dde06e",
                        "entry_id": "d2c7525d-3762-3bc3-aa92-8d4502f6c00e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Enough to fill or make up a stream."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "90750b36-4ca4-4059-85a7-beb9e2a78c70",
                                "sense_id": "d3641689-a3ad-325a-97b4-bf3a54dde06e",
                                "text": "There was water, certainly, a whole streamful of it, but all of fifty feet away."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5310cacb-c746-4d99-9787-525e0b8f94bf",
                                "sense_id": "d3641689-a3ad-325a-97b4-bf3a54dde06e",
                                "text": "A streamful of sterile slime is before you and an arid plain behind you."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93754f11-cc37-490b-a8db-d52d7dc10afd",
                                "sense_id": "d3641689-a3ad-325a-97b4-bf3a54dde06e",
                                "text": "Our house was hot for him (not for us) , and his sweat glands would produce perspiration by the streamful."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "def57cca-a60b-45dc-98df-2820f5c94e74",
                                "sense_id": "d3641689-a3ad-325a-97b4-bf3a54dde06e",
                                "text": "Suddenly they were among many heads of hair, most of them below Reinhart's chin so that he seemed to be wading neck-deep in a streamful of swimming beaver."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bf59b4d0-1ebb-3a33-9d46-212b84836bc7",
                        "entry_id": "d2c7525d-3762-3bc3-aa92-8d4502f6c00e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A quantity that streams."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a6304cc-540a-4df0-95fe-7fb4a26d3ca1",
                                "sense_id": "bf59b4d0-1ebb-3a33-9d46-212b84836bc7",
                                "text": "Orr depended for sustenance on the streamful of smallfry created by Providence to feed the imperishably hopeful debtor. But even these waters sometimes ran sterile."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "505cfa84-f99f-4466-b3ea-1af36f37957c",
                                "sense_id": "bf59b4d0-1ebb-3a33-9d46-212b84836bc7",
                                "text": "No longer is each utterance like a piece of driftwood the speaker fished from a streamful of treasures, something cast off in the beyond that had just then washed up onto the beaches of the mind."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a9ed1c3-f604-4370-a787-1ab0615b2394",
                                "sense_id": "bf59b4d0-1ebb-3a33-9d46-212b84836bc7",
                                "text": "I staggered on hearing Archaic Achilles babbling streamfuls of nonsense About a dainty slave and screeching like rapids and tumbling Over those invectives into his tent,"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
